            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/202607012328374991_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/match1867466date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">挺进16强！西班牙3-0奥地利 奥亚萨瓦尔双响库库两助+进球被吹</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260703/zhanbao_image_1867466_1783025610_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260703/zhanbao_image_1867466_1783025610_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260703/zhanbao_image_1867466_1783025610_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>奥亚萨瓦尔双响，波罗破门，库库两献助攻；西班牙1/8决赛将战葡萄牙/克罗地亚胜者。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46d201f118cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">5次过人全场最多！官方：亚马尔当选西班牙3-0奥地利全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030551261621.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030551261621.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030551261621.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛西班牙3-0战胜奥地利，亚马尔赛后当选全场最佳球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46afa00bc9cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打破魔咒！西班牙时隔16年淘汰赛再取胜 曾点球负俄罗斯、摩洛哥</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46d9453b128.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46d9453b128.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46d9453b128.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙时隔16年再次在世界杯淘汰赛赢球，上一次还是在10年世界杯，他们一路夺冠。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46d0806059fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打破世界杯纪录！西蒙世界杯连续519分钟0丢球，超越曾加历史第一</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a382ccc67b95.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a382ccc67b95.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a382ccc67b95.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，西班牙3-0完胜奥地利，晋级16强。西班牙门将乌奈·西蒙继续保持零封，连续不丢球时长已经达到519分钟，创下世界杯纪录。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46d5eb82aebnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">最后一舞！C罗姐姐：据我了解，C罗将在本届世界杯后告别国家队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030546581937.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030546581937.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030546581937.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛葡萄牙vs克罗地亚的比赛将在今天7点打响，C罗的姐姐卡蒂娅接受了媒体采访，表示根据自己得到的消息，C罗将在本届世界杯后告别国家队，不会参加2028年欧洲杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46d77605d23native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗26次出场超越马特乌斯，升至世界杯历史第二，仅次于梅西29次</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240909/66de54073fecb.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240909/66de54073fecb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240909/66de54073fecb.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/16决赛葡萄牙vs克罗地亚首发出炉，41岁C罗和40岁莫德里奇先发。这分别是两人第26次和第23次出场。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46adda376f5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩脸上长痘痘上热搜？赛后照和采访均显示他皮肤正常</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.83" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030230036905.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.83" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.83" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030230036905.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030230036905.jpg"> </div><p>姆巴佩脸上长痘痘的画面近期成为了国外社媒和微博热议话题。Grok辟谣表示：这段视频里那些“凸起”是假的——是为了玩梗而后期编辑或夸张处理的。法国对瑞典那场比赛的真实转播画面显示，他的皮肤是完全正常的。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46d9614e9c7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">只谈比赛！佛得角赛前发布会禁问队长涉嫌强奸一事，记者提问被拒</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260629/6a414c508d6a7.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，佛得角将对阵阿根廷。据巴西环球体育报道，在佛得角队出席赛前新闻发布会时，有关其队长莱恩·门德斯涉嫌强奸一事被禁止提及，一些记者几次尝试追问都被跳过到了下一个话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46e857e1992native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">出局后首发声！巴尔韦德：为失败负责，但绝不会放弃代表国家出战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030638486924.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030638486924_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/202607030638486924_720.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯，乌拉圭排名H组第三无缘淘汰赛。队长巴尔韦德在个人社媒发声，表示自己会为乌拉圭的出局负起责任。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46e776a289enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">图赫尔：换人前我问了赖斯，他说为了球队还能坚持，但他非常疼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020751242761.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020751242761_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/202607020751242761_720.jpg"> </div><p>在英格兰2-1民主刚果的世界杯1/16决赛中，赖斯主动申请替换下场后立刻冰敷腘绳肌，这也引发了担忧，图赫尔在赛后也谈到了此事。</p><p><strong>【世界杯赛前声音】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46bf16d1c18native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷被保送？斯卡洛尼：社媒会放大任何发言，不给他们热度就行</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46c2832310b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46c2832310b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260703/6a46c2832310b.jpg"> </div><p>在对阵佛得角的赛前发布会上，阿根廷主帅斯卡洛尼被问到社交媒体上有人认为阿根廷受到国际足联偏袒的问题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-03/6a46c2f6172bfnative.h